    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DONGHUA HANG&quot;" target="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF VETERINARY AND PHARMACEUTICAL SCIENCES&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Donghua Hang collaborated with researchers from the University of Veterinary and Pharmaceutical Sciences in Brno, Czech Republic, to investigate the impact of housing systems on the behavior and welfare of laying hens."</data>
      <data key="d5">"collaboration, research"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0121</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
